<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent gangs are occupying thousands of homes in Mexico City while the arrest of a Gulf Cartel leader has sparked riots and violence in northern Mexico. A mayor who fought cartels was assassinated, and his son was later detained, prompting protests by truckers that were temporarily halted and then resumed after dialogue with authorities. Federal agents have charged 24 individuals in Tennessee with a Sinaloa Cartel drug-trafficking operation and indicted a Mexican engineer for building a cross-border drug tunnel. A journalist reported a cartel-run prison camp, and an official was arrested for covering up a mayor's cartel-linked killing. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxQWS1CNmxOSjRTN19MSjRSNUFBUWdtV2hLUlJBd21jd0RwMG5mTjZyc3JDT3dmUG5PNWVVTUhYbWotQVFEWTFjd3hvS3haOTdObjctT1ZaSXRVMmttejY0SE5PTFFKaDBIcG9VbWRYR2c4SnZkNlVZUGZtNmxHcDAtSTc3a0E5MWdWWDBYdklEZ1RqMjRnbXZoempKLTBCYUlHRUFWZWdKRTFxV1BPejFmSlZLdW83RUU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Patch&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPUUVibk9lbzhaa290UmRDdHhGUVNaMzAtQ0xvcVpMRTBBWkhFdzUwYzFVbWhneDNlZzVfd3RZbzdZX1NyWGxhMloyd3JDd0Q2V3JVQjI3Y1lvRGtwZlI3MlZrVUlTdkRYejNRVWpxenZ6YTdMbnZ0Nm5sTEkxOEJvckc1MGpfUGdsQko4RGVBdG10MlA2em5BZkQ3TzNVTlJELXVZSUhuYTc3RG5CNU55RHdTYzV5UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Department of Justice (.gov)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;upi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Fox News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPNEhWVDdDNHV4YnVhZURGOTd2bEN2OVVuUUdlMlMybDIxako0NmRHYmZTWVFaOGZjRFdHNXpkbWZsSUJOUW52cHdaVFZGUnZKd0p1NnJwM1EzcDFScldpS21oSjVvaG9VYjR1SkM0LWVxbVZqd3lkY21yeEEtU